        "next_required_object": "Compose the emitted groupwise quotient jets with the exact G3BM division multipliers for all 248 H02 source directions. Decide whether the target-degree quotient defect cancels; if it does not, reduce that explicit defect through the pole-six target chart before recursive H02/H11/H20 completion.",
